# Sync administration. All routes need the admin key. Run the requests top to bottom: later ones depend on
# the state the earlier ones create. The expected status code is written above each request.

@host = http://localhost:5103
@readerKey = demo-reader-key-0000
@adminKey = demo-admin-key-0000

### Status before any run (200, state "idle").
GET {{host}}/api/v1/sync/hotel_supplier-a/status
X-Api-Key: {{adminKey}}

### Start a deliberately slow run (100 documents per batch, 200 ms pause between batches) so it stays active for a while (202).
POST {{host}}/api/v1/sync/hotel_supplier-a/runs
X-Api-Key: {{adminKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "batchSize": 100, "interBatchDelayMs": 200 }

### Starting again while it is active (409, problem+json).
POST {{host}}/api/v1/sync/hotel_supplier-a/runs
X-Api-Key: {{adminKey}}

### Status while it runs: state "running", lastId is the last checkpointed id (200).
GET {{host}}/api/v1/sync/hotel_supplier-a/status
X-Api-Key: {{adminKey}}

### Cancel the active run; its checkpoint stays at the last completed batch (202).
POST {{host}}/api/v1/sync/hotel_supplier-a/cancel
X-Api-Key: {{adminKey}}

### Cancel again when nothing is running (409, problem+json).
POST {{host}}/api/v1/sync/hotel_supplier-a/cancel
X-Api-Key: {{adminKey}}

### Status after cancelling: state "cancelled" and the checkpoint id to resume from (200).
GET {{host}}/api/v1/sync/hotel_supplier-a/status
X-Api-Key: {{adminKey}}

### Resume with the configured defaults: continues after the checkpoint (202).
POST {{host}}/api/v1/sync/hotel_supplier-a/runs
X-Api-Key: {{adminKey}}

### Status once it has finished: state "completed" (200). Repeat this request until it does.
GET {{host}}/api/v1/sync/hotel_supplier-a/status
X-Api-Key: {{adminKey}}

### Sync the merged master collection too (202).
POST {{host}}/api/v1/sync/hotels/runs
X-Api-Key: {{adminKey}}

### Documents that could not be indexed, newest first (200). Empty unless the index rejected something. Pass nextCursor as ?cursor= for the next page.
GET {{host}}/api/v1/sync/deadletters?collection=hotel_supplier-a&pageSize=20
X-Api-Key: {{adminKey}}

### Dead letters with a cursor this API never issued (400, problem+json).
GET {{host}}/api/v1/sync/deadletters?cursor=not-a-cursor
X-Api-Key: {{adminKey}}

### A collection that is not configured (404, problem+json).
GET {{host}}/api/v1/sync/hotel_unknown/status
X-Api-Key: {{adminKey}}

### Out-of-range batch size (400, problem+json).
POST {{host}}/api/v1/sync/hotel_supplier-a/runs
X-Api-Key: {{adminKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "batchSize": 0 }

### A reader key on an admin route (403, problem+json).
GET {{host}}/api/v1/sync/hotel_supplier-a/status
X-Api-Key: {{readerKey}}

### No key at all (401, problem+json).
GET {{host}}/api/v1/sync/hotel_supplier-a/status
